a href=\"/wiki/Moai\" title=\"Moai\">Moai</a> covered in green mold, similar in texture to Mythril. \n</p><p>Due to being of similar nature, <b>Moldai</b> uses the same mesh as other Moais, made by InvertedReality.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>8/18/23 is the date of Map Revamp update.</li>\n<li>Mention of \"Alternate reality\" might imply that current events of the new map are happening in an alternate reality, and not in the past, like community likes to speculate.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903035100\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 69/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019427/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.332      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.332      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2337-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903035100 and revision id 11710. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Moai"],"links":[{"title":"Moai","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true}],"images":["Moldai.png"]}
